WHAT THIS COVERS

This licence covers what originates in this repository: the generated internal quantities
(NAME_qty.txt) and external profits (NAME_eui.txt), the per-dataset parameter choices, the
SHA-256 checksums (SOURCES.tsv, MANIFEST.sha256), the scripts under tools/, and the selection and
arrangement of the released collection.

WHAT IT DOES NOT COVER

From release v2.0.0-utilities onwards, no sequence of the SPMF dataset collection
(https://www.philippe-fournier-viger.com/spmf/) is distributed here. The quantitative databases
are assembled on the user's machine from SPMF files that the user downloads from SPMF. Rights in
those files remain with their original holders; this licence grants nothing over them.

ATTRIBUTION

Reusers must credit both this repository and the SPMF collection the sequences come from.

FULL TEXT

